<div class="g-prose"><p>Branches, filtering and Recent use <code>sidebar_tree.js</code>. The shared shell owns the header toggle, focus handoff and responsive open state. The sidebar slides with the page column using the expansion duration and standard easing; closing content stays visible during the slide but becomes inert immediately. Repeated toggles reverse the current transition. Resizing and reduced motion suppress the movement. The red Citator preview brand is a separate home link (<code>site.home</code>), with its own hover and pressed states. Stored Recent entries are checked before they are shown: only an opinion path, a title and a known tier are used.</p></div>

